sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Order as Order
  participant ODB as PostgreSQL<br/>Order DB
  participant Catalog as Catalog
  participant CDB as PostgreSQL<br/>Catalog DB

  Order->>Catalog: Deduct stock
  Catalog->>CDB: Commit RESERVED version 1
  Catalog-->>Order: APPLIED + reservationVersion
  Order->>ODB: Save PROCESSING + outbox

  break Order persistence or outbox write fails
    ODB--xOrder: Roll back Order transaction
    Order->>Catalog: Release stock<br/>reservationVersion 1
    Catalog->>CDB: Lock reservation and stock rows
    alt Matching RESERVED version
      Catalog->>CDB: Restore stock and mark RELEASED
      Catalog-->>Order: APPLIED
    else Same version already RELEASED
      Catalog-->>Order: REPLAYED<br/>no second restoration
    else Older release arrives late
      Catalog-->>Order: STALE<br/>newer reservation remains
    end
    Order-->>Order: Preserve original failure
  end

  Note over Order,Catalog: Compensation is tied to the version returned by Catalog.<br/>A delayed release cannot undo a newer reservation.
